@anon.d1ff9934ece6813bf2a30f9ce237ed68.2644 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [584 x i8] }> <{ [584 x i8] c"# `inline_const`\0A\0AThe tracking issue for this feature is: [#76001]\0A\0ASee also [`inline_const_pat`](inline-const-pat.md)\0A\0A------\0A\0AThis feature allows you to use inline constant expressions. For example, you can\0Aturn this code:\0A\0A```rust\0A# fn add_one(x: i32) -> i32 { x + 1 }\0Aconst MY_COMPUTATION: i32 = 1 + 2 * 3 / 4;\0A\0Afn main() {\0A    let x = add_one(MY_COMPUTATION);\0A}\0A```\0A\0Ainto this code:\0A\0A```rust\0A#![feature(inline_const)]\0A\0A# fn add_one(x: i32) -> i32 { x + 1 }\0Afn main() {\0A    let x = add_one(const { 1 + 2 * 3 / 4 });\0A}\0A```\0A\0A[#76001]: https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/76001\0A" }>, align 1
